#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9729 expect=violation domain=TE
#note "Neither TEENRL nor TEDUR is present in the dataset, so no Element can carry an end rule or a planned duration - the state the parents' All gate and both R-5.25 siblings skip. Every Check leaf is a dataset-level var_exists fact, so Sensitivity derives Dataset and the absence is reported ONCE although both records lack the pair (wave E four-state decomposition; the M15 shape - the parent has no remaining condition to hoist)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT | Treatment | First dose
